  "details": "I am not sure why this happens. I often use VRChat as a medium to afk in front of the mirror while I do something else in real life, just to listen to the music and passively enjoy the atmosphere of \"being there\". However, if my view is directed towards any avatar or user (this includes entities in mirror reflections as well) I will hear some white noise from my earphones that gets louder depending on the number of entities I have my eyes on. I think this problem has been prevalent for a long time, but it's about time we addressed this issue.",
